      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your foe manages to grab whatever you are holding in that hand and starts pulling!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Roll an <strong>Opposed Strength</strong> Test. Success or a draw means your enemy lets go. Loss by 1-4 SL means you lose your next Action but retain the item. Loss by 5+ SL means you drop what you held in that hand and your foe takes possession of it. If you were carrying it in both hands (like a two-handed weapon) you get to roll twice and pick the best result.</p>"
